{
  "about": "untrusted::defang_mentions and the app's defangMentions (D-3023): every @ becomes ＠ except one before a space, tab, LF or CR, another @ or the end. Typing into a terminal drops every other control character, form feed too, which would join the @ to what follows. Both suites read this file.",
